      <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-value">25<span style="font-size:15px">/25</span> <span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted)">vs</span> <span style="font-size:20px;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--text-muted)">8</span></div><div class="kpi-label">Requirements met</div><div class="kpi-sub">Smarty: 8 met &middot; 8 partial &middot; 9 not met</div></div>
