<section class="block" id="scoreboard" style="background:var(--surface-1);border-block:1px solid var(--border)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="overline">Side by Side</div>
      <h2>Dimension by dimension</h2>
      <p>The two overlap on postal parsing quality and diverge sharply on financial messaging &mdash; exactly as their designs predict.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap reveal">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Smarty</th><th class="win">ioNova ARS</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Architecture</td><td>Postal reference-data lookup + AI-enhanced fuzzy matching; built for checkout &amp; logistics</td><td class="win">Deterministic rule engine + reference data + entity extraction; built for financial messaging</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Output scope</td><td>Postal-standard JSON; ~350 enrichment attributes</td><td class="win">Corrected ISO 20022 XML + 30 reason codes + per-field confidence</td></tr>
          <tr><td>SWIFT MT parsing</td><td>None &mdash; nine of 25 requirements scored zero</td><td class="win">Native (MT103 / MT202 fields 50 / 52 / 56 / 57 / 59)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Financial identifiers</td><td>&ldquo;A BIC or IBAN embedded in an address line will be treated as address text and likely mislabelled or discarded&rdquo;</td><td class="win">50+ types extracted and preserved pre-parse</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Confidence &amp; routing</td><td>Categorical statuses (Verified / Partial / Ambiguous / None) &mdash; not calibrated for STP threshold routing</td><td class="win">0.0&ndash;1.0 per-field confidence with three-tier auto / review / manual routing</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Operational tooling <span class="badge badge-accent">New</span></td><td>Build your own review queue and monitoring</td><td class="win">Exceptions Workbench + live dashboards, built in</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Onboarding <span class="badge badge-accent">New</span></td><td>Under 4 weeks for postal use &mdash; 26&ndash;40 weeks fitted to payments</td><td class="win">Developer Portal sandbox in days; live in 2&ndash;4 weeks</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Composite score</td><td class="mono">1.75 / 5.00</td><td class="win mono">4.90 / 5.00</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Risk-adjusted score</td><td class="mono">0.00 / 5.00 (floored)</td><td class="win mono">4.90 / 5.00 &mdash; no penalties</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Verdict</td><td>Not recommended for FI payment parsing &mdash; keep for non-payment lanes</td><td class="win">Recommended &mdash; primary financial-messaging parser</td></tr>
        </tbody>
